#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tools for the directed execution model {#tools-for-the-directed-execution-"
"model}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following tools can be used together to implement an error mitigation "
"technique in the directed execution model.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
